    <string name="setup_about_privacy_title">Nothing leaves your phone</string>
    <string name="setup_about_privacy_body">Lagoon has no internet permission, so it cannot send anything anywhere: no analytics, no crash reports, no accounts. Notification access is used only to show what is playing, who is calling and the notifications you choose; the text stays in memory and is dropped when the island clears it.</string>
